      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.wisdomlib.org/cities/vineyard-12636"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Vineyard is an unincorporated community, not a city, yet it serves as a gateway for travelers heading to Napa and Sonoma’s famed vineyards.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        24,
        25
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.wisdomlib.org/cities/vineyard-12636"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "A planned expansion could add up to 20,000 homes, potentially swelling the population by 60,000 residents.",
